.TH CD-DRIVE "1" "August 2026" "cd-drive version 2.4.0 x86_64-pc-linux-gnu" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
cd-drive \- show CD-ROM drive characteristics
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B cd-drive
[\fI\,OPTION\/\fR...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-debug\fR=\fI\,INT\/\fR
Set debugging to LEVEL
.TP
\fB\-i\fR, \fB\-\-cdrom\-device\fR[=\fI\,DEVICE\/\fR]
show only info about CD\-ROM device
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Don't produce warning output
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
display version and copyright information
and exit
